  "construction": "Three editable tall orthogonal-plank frames retain native sparse spine groups and upright/horizontal/leaning arrangement. A shallow bottom support board within the native frame extent and book bases seated on boards are explicit physical-construction interpretation. Open-backed compartments preserve source negative space; actual backing construction is not established by the tiny icon. Exact spine thickness/heights, seams and dust remain authored.",
  "native_state": {
    "owner": "RandomTile builder and XRL.World.Parts.Inventory",
    "assembly_sha256": "cfd20cf1d6126bb64c9362311b9611fe0450589e21d51db00536af32d63150a7",
    "inventory_stdout_sha256": "37dca43dbe6512d6ce734e21aad8308f887704767dd6c1ea900e628b5c963628",
    "rule": "Inherited RandomTile remains three bookshelf layouts despite child default tile1. Inventory.CheckEmptyState reads EmptyDetailColor k; CheckNonEmptyState reads FullDetailColor W. No EmptyTile/FullTile tags are declared for this chain. Joppa child changes inventory population to JoppaBookshelf; pictured spines are cosmetic source marks, not actual item identities."
  },
